1
00:00:04,500 --> 00:00:05,600
Huh?

2
00:00:05,600 --> 00:00:08,530
Wait, what's going on here?

3
00:00:09,580 --> 00:00:12,950
If anything comes up, I'll drop it 
in the group chat we just made.

4
00:00:11,280 --> 00:00:12,950
Who could've seen
this coming?

5
00:00:11,530 --> 00:00:12,950
Life is strange,
and I feel alive

6
00:00:13,370 --> 00:00:14,450
Okay, see you.

7
00:00:18,070 --> 00:00:21,160
<i>Mizuhara... Mizuhara!</i>

8
00:00:21,980 --> 00:00:23,760
I'll get going, too.

9
00:00:22,880 --> 00:00:24,880
Cruel world!!

10
00:00:24,880 --> 00:00:26,840
dun

11
00:00:27,110 --> 00:00:28,800
Wait, who is this?

12
00:00:28,800 --> 00:00:32,090
His name means
"Sword of truth" in Malay

13
00:00:29,140 --> 00:00:32,450
I'm letting him stay in your room.

14
00:00:32,340 --> 00:00:34,010
Don't assume you'll
have your grandmother
and your room forever

15
00:00:32,450 --> 00:00:34,010
Wait, my room?!

16
00:00:32,600 --> 00:00:34,010
You're not
using it

17
00:00:34,310 --> 00:00:37,980
I'll look for a new place

18
00:00:34,450 --> 00:00:37,980
<i>Everything's destroying my mental state.</i>

19
00:00:35,310 --> 00:00:37,980
while I eat...

20
00:01:34,700 --> 00:01:36,410
I thought I was good at going it alone

21
00:01:34,700 --> 00:01:36,410
Would you prefer to go together?

22
00:02:03,230 --> 00:02:03,940
Place
your finger here

23
00:02:22,000 --> 00:02:25,080
Rent-a-Girlfriend

24
00:02:27,250 --> 00:02:29,960
"Moving and Girlfriend"

25
00:02:31,550 --> 00:02:32,800
Hey, Kazuya.

26
00:02:34,030 --> 00:02:35,240
Kazuya!

27
00:02:37,670 --> 00:02:39,090
Wake up already!

28
00:02:39,090 --> 00:02:41,720
The members of the shopping arcade 
association are coming over today.

29
00:02:42,420 --> 00:02:44,540
And why aren't you at school?

30
00:02:44,540 --> 00:02:47,560
Are you trying to turn the living 
room into your bedroom?

31
00:02:47,860 --> 00:02:55,150
voom

32
00:02:47,950 --> 00:02:50,780
But most of all, 
what's with all the snack bags?

33
00:02:49,610 --> 00:02:55,150
It shows
your character

34
00:02:50,780 --> 00:02:52,300
Did you go to sleep without brushing?!

35
00:02:52,300 --> 00:02:55,150
Ow! Sorry! I said I'm sorry!

36
00:02:55,690 --> 00:02:57,910
Good morning.

37
00:02:56,820 --> 00:03:00,870
Right, you have
a PM shift

38
00:02:57,910 --> 00:02:59,950
Hello there, Saifur.

39
00:03:03,860 --> 00:03:05,000
<i>Wha?!</i>

40
00:03:06,630 --> 00:03:11,300
<i>Heh, guess I have no place here anymore.</i>

41
00:03:11,350 --> 00:03:14,010
This ain't too bad

42
00:03:14,220 --> 00:03:16,970
Savings Account

43
00:03:14,220 --> 00:03:16,970
Credit (Yen)                             Debit (Yen)                                      Balance (Yen)

44
00:03:14,380 --> 00:03:16,970
<i>I have 5,400 yen in my account.</i>

45
00:03:16,970 --> 00:03:21,930
Sigh...

46
00:03:16,970 --> 00:03:21,930
Sighs of the nation

47
00:03:16,970 --> 00:03:21,930
This is just
pocket change

48
00:03:17,010 --> 00:03:21,930
I had no idea
I was in such
a bad way...!!

49
00:03:17,050 --> 00:03:21,930
Poverty...!!

50
00:03:17,790 --> 00:03:21,930
<i>Sure, payday's coming up, but that's 
no number for an account balance.</i>

51
00:03:22,950 --> 00:03:26,140
<i>I don't regret the money 
I spent on Mizuhara.</i>

52
00:03:26,140 --> 00:03:29,810
<i>I did end up having huge 
unforeseen expenses, too.</i>

53
00:03:30,110 --> 00:03:37,280
This is no time
to be depressed!!

54
00:03:30,110 --> 00:03:37,280
I need to find a new place

55
00:03:31,240 --> 00:03:34,610
<i>This is what I get for skipping work 
so many times at the start of the year!</i>

56
00:03:34,610 --> 00:03:37,280
<i>I can't do anything 
with this paltry capital!</i>

57
00:03:37,570 --> 00:03:41,000
I can't waste a single yen 
with the apartment visits.

58
00:03:41,000 --> 00:03:43,490
The new place can't be 
any more expensive, either.

59
00:03:43,490 --> 00:03:50,710
RealEstateSearch.com

60
00:03:43,490 --> 00:03:50,710
Search

61
00:03:43,490 --> 00:03:50,710
Max Rent

62
00:03:43,490 --> 00:03:50,710
Min Rent

63
00:03:43,940 --> 00:03:47,030
Moving season just ended, so there 
won't be many places available.

64
00:03:47,030 --> 00:03:50,710
And if it's not a walkable distance from 
school, I'll just spend more money.

65
00:03:48,040 --> 00:03:50,710
35,000 yen...

66
00:03:50,710 --> 00:03:52,000
Found 1 result

67
00:03:50,710 --> 00:03:53,110
<i>Ack, just one result?</i>

68
00:03:52,210 --> 00:03:54,340
Available from May 19

69
00:03:53,110 --> 00:03:56,300
<i>And I can't move in 
until a month from now?</i>

70
00:03:56,340 --> 00:04:00,260
Cries of
the nation

71
00:03:56,550 --> 00:03:57,890
<i>I'm screwed.</i>

72
00:03:57,890 --> 00:04:00,260
<i>Rent in Tokyo is way too high!</i>

73
00:04:01,230 --> 00:04:04,970
<i>I had to look for ages 
before finding Royal Hills, too.</i>

74
00:04:01,300 --> 00:04:04,970
A super
cheap apartment...

75
00:04:05,020 --> 00:04:10,940
She's way too frugal

76
00:04:05,330 --> 00:04:10,940
<i>It was a miracle that a girl like 
Mizuhara was living in that dump.</i>

77
00:04:11,670 --> 00:04:14,240
<i>Wonder what she's doing right now.</i>

78
00:04:14,240 --> 00:04:18,830
<i>She said she was going home. 
Won't she feel lonely all by herself?</i>

79
00:04:19,400 --> 00:04:23,160
<i>She's currently investigating, 
so maybe I can suggest we be roommates.</i>

80
00:04:23,750 --> 00:04:25,480
<i>Wait, what am I thinking?</i>

81
00:04:24,200 --> 00:04:30,670
There're all sorts
of issues with that!!

82
00:04:24,200 --> 00:04:30,670
You and your delusions!!

83
00:04:25,480 --> 00:04:26,980
<i>That's living together!</i>

84
00:04:26,980 --> 00:04:30,670
<i>She'd never move in with 
a guy she's not even dating!</i>

85
00:04:33,350 --> 00:04:36,840
<i>And she doesn't seem anywhere 
near ready to start dating me.</i>

86
00:04:37,230 --> 00:04:41,800
<i>So what is she thinking? 
She's not getting in touch with me.</i>

87
00:04:42,380 --> 00:04:48,390
<i>She's gonna carry on with her life, 
and she'll keep meeting other guys.</i>

88
00:04:42,720 --> 00:04:48,390
Not to doubt her
or anything

89
00:04:49,030 --> 00:04:52,350
<i>We might just end up drifting apart.</i>

90
00:04:54,610 --> 00:04:56,280
Ugh

91
00:04:54,610 --> 00:04:56,280
Not again!

92
00:04:56,670 --> 00:05:01,180
<i>She has nothing to worry 
about in that regard.</i>

93
00:05:01,180 --> 00:05:04,810
<i>She's only looking into 
her own feelings, anyway.</i>

94
00:05:04,810 --> 00:05:09,890
<i>And if my feelings change, 
she'll just move on.</i>

95
00:05:11,170 --> 00:05:18,510
We're too far apart!!

96
00:05:11,170 --> 00:05:18,510
I love her
even if she doesn't
feel the same way!!

97
00:05:12,010 --> 00:05:15,100
<i>That sounds like she 
doesn't like me at all!</i>

98
00:05:15,100 --> 00:05:18,510
<i>Damn it! This is the problem 
with super-popular girls!</i>

99
00:05:18,910 --> 00:05:21,280
The moment you fall in love, 
you're fighting a losing battle.

100
00:05:21,280 --> 00:05:23,470
And the only weapon you have is passion.

101
00:05:25,790 --> 00:05:28,390
<i>There's nothing I can do 
but keep giving her my love.</i>

102
00:05:29,160 --> 00:05:31,720
<i>Wait, guys have, like, no power here.</i>

103
00:05:32,660 --> 00:05:35,310
<i>What ever happened to gender equality?</i>

104
00:05:51,390 --> 00:05:53,130
Hello, Chizuru-chan.

105
00:05:53,130 --> 00:05:54,420
Long time no see.

106
00:05:54,420 --> 00:05:55,580
Hello.

107
00:05:55,580 --> 00:05:58,400
You're looking more and more 
like your mother.

108
00:05:58,860 --> 00:06:00,340
You think so?

109
00:06:08,070 --> 00:06:09,150
I'm home.

110
00:06:12,060 --> 00:06:13,420
I'm home.

111
00:06:14,790 --> 00:06:16,320
Welcome back.

112
00:06:41,340 --> 00:06:43,010
Miso soup
with tofu

113
00:06:41,340 --> 00:06:43,010
Rice

114
00:06:41,340 --> 00:06:43,010
Mackerel w/ miso

115
00:06:41,340 --> 00:06:43,010
Beans
(5 types)

116
00:06:41,340 --> 00:06:43,010
Orange

117
00:06:41,340 --> 00:06:43,010
Broccoli

118
00:06:41,340 --> 00:06:43,010
Tomato

119
00:06:43,260 --> 00:06:44,570
Time to eat.

120
00:06:44,970 --> 00:06:47,480
<i>So, you got some high scores.</i>

121
00:06:47,480 --> 00:06:49,570
<i>How do you two feel about that?</i>

122
00:06:49,570 --> 00:06:52,000
<i>It's all down to me.</i>

123
00:06:52,000 --> 00:06:55,360
<i>I wrote the material, too, 
so this is my personal score.</i>

124
00:06:55,360 --> 00:06:56,860
<i>Yeah, right.</i>

125
00:06:56,860 --> 00:06:58,770
<i>Wait, are you serious? 
I was there with you!</i>

126
00:06:59,120 --> 00:07:01,730
<i>You all saw me there, right?</i>

127
00:07:02,010 --> 00:07:04,110
What's wrong? Do you have a cold?

128
00:07:05,150 --> 00:07:08,110
I'm fine. You worry too much.

129
00:08:00,580 --> 00:08:03,550
Kawanaki Hiroki

130
00:08:00,580 --> 00:08:03,550
Kinoshita Kazuya

131
00:08:00,580 --> 00:08:03,550
Kelly

132
00:08:00,580 --> 00:08:03,550
Director Koga

133
00:08:10,350 --> 00:08:11,470
I should do the dishes.

134
00:08:13,430 --> 00:08:16,390
South Narimasu Arcade

135
00:08:16,390 --> 00:08:20,210
What's up, Yaemori-san? 
Why'd you ask me to come out?

136
00:08:20,650 --> 00:08:23,620
Why at this hour?

137
00:08:20,980 --> 00:08:25,290
I figured we could chat if you were 
feeling awkward in your family home.

138
00:08:24,650 --> 00:08:28,950
Bingo

139
00:08:25,850 --> 00:08:28,620
You're totally... not wrong.

140
00:08:29,200 --> 00:08:34,280
You can come over (for 2 mins)

141
00:08:29,290 --> 00:08:34,280
<i>Kibe and Kuribayashi were heartless, 
so I'm grateful for the invite.</i>

142
00:08:30,450 --> 00:08:34,280
I hate guys, actually

143
00:08:34,590 --> 00:08:36,940
You know what I think?

144
00:08:38,350 --> 00:08:41,750
I think you and Mizuhara-san 
need to live together!

145
00:08:43,270 --> 00:08:44,210
Huh?

146
00:08:44,830 --> 00:08:46,720
What do you mean?

147
00:08:47,490 --> 00:08:51,930
<i>What is she even saying? 
I mean, I would if I could.</i>

148
00:08:51,930 --> 00:08:55,140
<i>But why suddenly bring this up? 
Does she have a plan?</i>

149
00:08:58,180 --> 00:09:00,160
Anyway, let's go drink!

150
00:09:00,160 --> 00:09:01,600
No plan

151
00:09:00,160 --> 00:09:01,600
Nope! No plan!

152
00:09:01,600 --> 00:09:04,300
It all starts with a 
brainstorming session!

153
00:09:01,900 --> 00:09:10,070
Getting chased out
of your apartment
is a living together setup

154
00:09:03,150 --> 00:09:10,070
I realized that while
watching a rom-com

155
00:09:04,300 --> 00:09:06,890
As your official main supporter,

156
00:09:05,650 --> 00:09:10,070
Love will save the world!

157
00:09:06,890 --> 00:09:10,070
I can't let you two be!

158
00:09:07,230 --> 00:09:08,480
Since when?

159
00:09:10,420 --> 00:09:12,110
Also, what's with the cat ears?

160
00:09:12,110 --> 00:09:14,250
Oh, I just forgot to take 'em off.

161
00:09:14,250 --> 00:09:16,030
<i>Why'd you even have them on?</i>

162
00:09:17,720 --> 00:09:20,190
<i>She's not a bad kid, really.</i>

163
00:09:20,540 --> 00:09:26,750
You said you were going over

164
00:09:20,540 --> 00:09:26,750
For better or for worse,
they're blah about everything

165
00:09:20,990 --> 00:09:22,990
Your friends are okay 
with you stepping out?

166
00:09:22,990 --> 00:09:26,750
Totally. I told 'em I had 
important matters to take care of.

167
00:09:27,250 --> 00:09:31,470
<i>Well, I felt weird being home, 
and this will help get my mind off things.</i>

168
00:09:33,430 --> 00:09:37,340
Like, aren't you lonely, 
being separated from Mizuhara-san?!

169
00:09:37,340 --> 00:09:39,520
Aren't you being assailed 
by infinite sadness?!

170
00:09:41,900 --> 00:09:44,020
No! Nothing like that!

171
00:09:44,690 --> 00:09:48,650
Blegh

172
00:09:44,730 --> 00:09:48,650
hic

173
00:09:47,960 --> 00:09:50,610
Mizuhara!

174
00:09:50,610 --> 00:09:53,740
Cry all you want tonight.

175
00:09:54,940 --> 00:09:58,020
Sorry! I'm so sorry!

176
00:09:57,580 --> 00:10:00,870
You really went to town

177
00:09:58,020 --> 00:10:00,870
No prob. It's good to know 
that you're actually hurting.

178
00:10:01,240 --> 00:10:04,710
I have no idea what she's thinking!

179
00:10:04,710 --> 00:10:09,090
I mean, we lived in that building 
for two whole years!

180
00:10:09,090 --> 00:10:14,970
Even if she feels nothing for me, 
does she have no attachment to the place?

181
00:10:15,240 --> 00:10:19,300
Yeah... but she did say 
she'd look into it.

182
00:10:19,300 --> 00:10:24,190
I find it hard to believe she 
won't miss you at all, either.

183
00:10:25,400 --> 00:10:26,900
Yeah! That's exactly it!

184
00:10:27,150 --> 00:10:33,490
What is she,
an android?!

185
00:10:27,180 --> 00:10:30,880
That means she has some 
positive feelings for me!

186
00:10:30,880 --> 00:10:33,490
But did you see her face? Zero emotion!

187
00:10:33,800 --> 00:10:35,800
Wonder where her family home is.

188
00:10:36,350 --> 00:10:39,240
Around a ten-minute walk from the station?

189
00:10:39,240 --> 00:10:40,740
Wait, why do you know this?!

190
00:10:39,490 --> 00:10:40,740
Oops

191
00:10:40,790 --> 00:10:46,670
That's amazing progress!!

192
00:10:41,080 --> 00:10:44,740
You went there?! You need 
to share this stuff with me!

193
00:10:44,740 --> 00:10:46,670
I was going to tell you, okay?

194
00:10:46,710 --> 00:10:50,670
I slipped up...

195
00:10:47,510 --> 00:10:50,540
She was planning to put it up for sale.

196
00:10:50,540 --> 00:10:53,700
I just went to help clean it up. 
It was nothing special.

197
00:10:51,210 --> 00:10:54,260
I was just
manual labor

198
00:10:56,500 --> 00:10:57,830
What are you saying?!

199
00:10:57,830 --> 00:11:00,470
You think she'd invite a guy she feels 
nothing for over to her family home?!

200
00:11:00,510 --> 00:11:02,430
Truth nuke...

201
00:11:02,430 --> 00:11:05,880
But now I'm actually worried.

202
00:11:05,880 --> 00:11:06,400
Huh?

203
00:11:06,740 --> 00:11:09,590
This investigation's 
actually a risky gamble.

204
00:11:09,590 --> 00:11:13,540
The fact that she's developed feelings 
and still doesn't have an answer

205
00:11:13,540 --> 00:11:16,990
could mean she doesn't intend 
to give you one at all.

206
00:11:16,990 --> 00:11:20,460
I mean, she could've done this 
while you were dating.

207
00:11:17,030 --> 00:11:19,740
Concerning

208
00:11:20,460 --> 00:11:22,950
This is basically a waste of your time.

209
00:11:23,210 --> 00:11:26,930
Any other guy would take 
the hint and walk away.

210
00:11:26,930 --> 00:11:29,620
I'm not doubting Mizuhara-san here,

211
00:11:29,620 --> 00:11:32,880
but in general, 
girls like that are bad news.

212
00:11:33,720 --> 00:11:35,210
I'll give it a real shot.

213
00:11:38,580 --> 00:11:39,620
No way.

214
00:11:40,490 --> 00:11:41,470
Huh?

215
00:11:41,700 --> 00:11:44,930
I'm grateful you're taking my side,

216
00:11:45,380 --> 00:11:49,900
but I believe in Mizuhara.

217
00:11:50,400 --> 00:11:52,130
With all my heart.

218
00:11:53,660 --> 00:11:56,900
You're so in love, it's almost laughable.

219
00:11:56,900 --> 00:11:59,660
That's what's so great about you, though.

220
00:11:59,660 --> 00:12:00,870
Well, I'm not laughing.

221
00:12:00,870 --> 00:12:07,790
I was just speaking
in general terms

222
00:12:01,210 --> 00:12:04,680
But I believe in Mizuhara-san, too.

223
00:12:04,680 --> 00:12:07,790
I'm still cheering you two on, 
no matter what.

224
00:12:09,750 --> 00:12:11,380
Wait, what?

225
00:12:11,380 --> 00:12:14,460
I just sent a pic of you to our 
three-person group chat.

226
00:12:14,460 --> 00:12:15,960
Royal Hills Refugees (3)

227
00:12:14,460 --> 00:12:15,960
Yaemori Mini

228
00:12:15,960 --> 00:12:16,980
Huh?!

229
00:12:17,930 --> 00:12:20,500
What?! What's wrong with you?!

230
00:12:18,260 --> 00:12:20,470
clatter

231
00:12:18,260 --> 00:12:20,470
Who said
you could?!

232
00:12:20,500 --> 00:12:23,600
I bet Mizuhara-san's 
lonely all by herself, too.

233
00:12:23,600 --> 00:12:25,220
Are you outta your mind?

234
00:12:25,220 --> 00:12:27,430
Are you really trying 
to help with this pic?!

235
00:12:27,430 --> 00:12:30,400
If you had to

236
00:12:27,740 --> 00:12:30,400
Send something better!

237
00:12:30,440 --> 00:12:36,360
That beauty's getting
too comfortable

238
00:12:30,640 --> 00:12:32,590
It's fine.

239
00:12:32,590 --> 00:12:36,360
You need to light a fire under her ass 
by showing you're alone with a girl.

240
00:12:36,360 --> 00:12:38,570
You know that's not gonna work.

241
00:12:36,860 --> 00:12:38,570
Not Mizuhara
of all people...

242
00:12:41,990 --> 00:12:44,950
Ichinose Chizuru

243
00:12:41,990 --> 00:12:44,950
Someone's having fun

244
00:12:48,340 --> 00:12:50,150
See? Just look at this!

245
00:12:49,160 --> 00:12:52,380
Just text

246
00:12:50,150 --> 00:12:52,380
"Someone's having fun," she says. 
Are you kidding me?!

247
00:12:52,380 --> 00:12:56,210
Ichinose Chizuru

248
00:12:52,380 --> 00:12:56,210
Someone's having fun

249
00:12:52,730 --> 00:12:54,530
Wouldn't you normally use an emoji there?

250
00:12:54,530 --> 00:12:56,210
Is she made of metal?!

251
00:12:56,210 --> 00:13:01,220
She's not lonely
at all!!

252
00:12:56,210 --> 00:13:01,220
Feels like she
messed up again

253
00:12:56,210 --> 00:13:01,220
Good thing she
replied, huh!!

254
00:12:56,210 --> 00:12:58,930
Her heart hasn't budged an inch!

255
00:12:58,930 --> 00:13:01,220
She doesn't care about me at all!

